🇷🇺⚔️🇺🇦 Key points from Putin's interview with Vesti journalist Zarubin:

➡️Russian Armed Forces strikes on Ukrainian infrastructure are effective and timely, they help troops accomplish their combat objectives;

➡️Russian military strikes on Ukraine have a direct and positive effect on the conduct of combat operations;

➡️Russia was meant to be brought to collapse. Neo-Nazis today take particular satisfaction in strikes on civilians;

➡️No turning point in the confrontation with Russia has resulted from Ukrainian Armed Forces strikes;

➡️Russia has increased strikes on Ukrainian enterprises in response to Ukrainian Armed Forces strikes on civilian facilities in Russia;

➡️The Kiev regime itself "opened Pandora's box" by starting strikes on economic facilities;

➡️Russian retaliatory strikes are more destructive than Ukrainian Armed Forces strikes on Russia;

➡️Russian forces have increased the pace of their advance, confidently accomplishing the objectives of the special military operation;

➡️Russia's responses to Ukrainian Armed Forces provocations are proving sensitive for Kiev. Catastrophic trends for the Kiev regime are becoming visible;

➡️Proposals received by Russia from the Kiev regime are at times exotic and unacceptable;

➡️Kiev authorities themselves "let the genie out of the bottle" by starting strikes on civilian facilities;

➡️The enemy is trying to intimidate Russians and disrupt the elections, but this attempt is doomed to fail;

➡️Putin called his support for United Russia natural, since he was one of the party's founders at one point.

